      "source_id": "S1",
      "source_type": "user_report",
      "text": "我明天下午 3 点 AI 产品经理二面，这是我的简历和 JD。\n\n一面主要聊了我的 AI 教育项目，面试官问了挺多技术问题，包括 Agent 怎么控制 Minecraft、模型乱说怎么办、多人同时上课怎么处理。\n\n我感觉自己技术部分答得一般，但产品部分聊得还可以。\n\n二面不知道是谁面，我今晚大概还有 5 个小时。\n\n我应该刷产品题、准备行为面，还是继续补技术？"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "S2",
      "source_type": "resume",
      "text": "CityU CS Master\n\nProject: AI-native Minecraft English Learning Platform\n\n- Led the product from 0→1\n- Designed AI Teacher interaction workflow\n- Coordinated a small cross-functional team\n- Integrated LLM, ASR/TTS and Minecraft runtime\n- Built a multi-student collaborative learning experience"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "S3",
      "source_type": "jd",
      "text": "AI Product Manager\n\nResponsibilities:\n- Design AI-native user experiences\n- Work with engineering and research teams\n- Define evaluation metrics\n- Ship LLM-powered products\n\nPreferred:\n- Familiar with agent systems\n- Strong product sense\n- Able to discuss technical tradeoffs"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "S4",
      "source_type": "hr_chat",
      "text": "HR:\n“一面通过了，二面会继续深入聊项目。”"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "S5",
      "source_type": "user_report",
      "text": "“我感觉技术答得一般。”"
    }
  ],
